{
	"addonId": "musicLyricFinder",
	"displayName": "Music & Lyrics Finder",
	"URL": "https://github.com/Surveyor123/musicLyricFinder/releases/download/v0.2.0/musicLyricFinder-0.2.0.nvda-addon",
	"description": "Identify music playing around you or on your computer, and pull up its lyrics.\nRecognize by listening captures your configured microphone and/or system-audio (loopback) device — either one alone, or both mixed together at once if you've set up both in settings. Recognize from file identifies a track from an audio file already on your computer.\nOnce a track is recognized, fetch and read its lyrics in a browsable window with a single keystroke. The recognized track can optionally be copied to the clipboard automatically, and the beep sound played during recognition can be turned off.",
